{
  "id": "a1-m03-l1",
  "version": 1,
  "level": "A1",
  "module": 3,
  "order": 1,
  "title": "Sonlar va yosh",
  "title_de": "Zahlen und Alter",
  "goal": "Dars oxirida 1 dan 29 gacha sonlarni aytasiz va eshitib taniysiz, \"Wie alt bist du?\" deb so'raysiz va \"Ich bin ... Jahre alt.\" bilan yoshingizni to'g'ri aytasiz.",
  "skill_focus": [
    "vocabulary",
    "listening",
    "speaking"
  ],
  "explanation": [
    {
      "type": "p",
      "text": "1 dan 12 gacha sonlarni yod olish kerak. 13 dan 19 gacha qoida oddiy: birlik + zehn (o'n). 21 dan boshlab sonlar o'zbek tilidagidan teskari aytiladi: avval birlik, keyin \"und\", keyin o'nlik: einundzwanzig = bir va yigirma = 21."
    },
    {
      "type": "table",
      "headers": [
        "Son",
        "Nemischa",
        "Diqqat"
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          "0",
          "null",
          ""
        ],
        [
          "1",
          "eins",
          "sanashda eins; \"ein\" — bitta (ot oldidan)"
        ],
        [
          "2",
          "zwei",
          "telefonda ko'pincha \"zwo\""
        ],
        [
          "13",
          "dreizehn",
          "drei + zehn"
        ],
        [
          "16",
          "sechzehn",
          "sechs → sech (s tushadi)"
        ],
        [
          "17",
          "siebzehn",
          "sieben → sieb (en tushadi)"
        ],
        [
          "20",
          "zwanzig",
          ""
        ],
        [
          "21",
          "einundzwanzig",
          "ein + und + zwanzig (eins emas!)"
        ],
        [
          "25",
          "fünfundzwanzig",
          "5 + und + 20"
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "text": "Yoshni so'rash: \"Wie alt bist du?\" (do'stga), \"Wie alt sind Sie?\" (rasmiy). Javob \"sein\" fe'li bilan: \"Ich bin zwanzig Jahre alt.\" yoki qisqa: \"Ich bin zwanzig.\""
    },
    {
      "type": "tip",
      "text": "O'zbekcha \"20 yoshim bor\" deb o'ylab \"Ich habe 20 Jahre\" demang! Nemis tilida yosh \"sein\" bilan aytiladi: Ich bin 20 Jahre alt."
    },
    {
      "type": "tip",
      "text": "Germaniyada notanish kattalardan yoshini so'rash odobsizlik hisoblanishi mumkin. Bolalar, do'stlar va rasmiy anketalarda esa yosh so'raladi."
    }
  ],
