        "de": "Wie alt sind Sie, Frau Rahimova?",
        "uz": "Necha yoshdasiz, Rahimova xonim?"
      },
      {
        "speaker": "Siz",
        "de": "Ich bin siebenundzwanzig Jahre alt.",
        "uz": "Yigirma yetti yoshdaman."
      },
      {
